    /* The x86_64 block has the reasoning: two compares, then three loads
       from unicode_width_tab and a shift, or the planes past U+3FFFF by
       compare. w0 is the code and x1 the variant. Constants past twelve
       bits come from movz, and the leaf base is the block base plus 3,856,
       which add takes whole. */
